    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A modification made only to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pistols\" title=\"Pistols\">Pistols</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifles\" title=\"Rifles\">Rifles</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Weapons\" title=\"Heavy Weapons\">Heavy Weapons</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)\" title=\"Exotic Weapons (Ranged)\">Exotic Weapons (Ranged)</a> that use a trigger mechanism to fire, the Hair Trigger accessory makes it easier to fire several shots in quick succession by reducing the amount of pressure that must be placed on the trigger. Once per encounter, the wielder of a weapon with a Hair Trigger that uses the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Shot\" title=\"Rapid Shot\">Rapid Shot</a> Feat to modify an attack roll may reroll the damage from the attack, keeping the better result. </p>",
